This repository includes code adapted from the a2a-samples project
(https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-samples, Apache License 2.0):
identity/internal/cardsig/cardsig.go and its copies in zk-component/ and pq-identity/
adapt the Go "sign and verify agent card" sample (canonicalization and JWS layout);
the key provider was changed to resolve key ids through the operator registry.

pq-identity/tools/pqtpm (the C bridge to the wolfTPM firmware-TPM emulator) links
wolfTPM and wolfSSL, which are GPLv3, and is itself licensed under GPLv3
(pq-identity/tools/pqtpm/LICENSE); the Apache-2.0 Go code executes it as a separate
process. Other third-party dependencies are fetched by the build tools under their own
licences (see docs/TOOLS.md). The paper template fonts (Old Standard TT) are under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1 (paper/fonts/).
